{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17596","headline":"和武相早朝中书候传点书怀奉呈 · 羊士谔","name":"和武相早朝中书候传点书怀奉呈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殿省秘清晓，夔龙升紫微。\n星辰拱帝座，劒履翊天机。\n耿耿金波缺，沉沉玉漏稀。\n彩笺蹲鸷兽，画扇列名翬。\n志业丹青重，恩华雨露霏。\n三台昭建极，一德庆垂衣。\n昌运瞻文敎，雄图本武威。\n殊勳如带远，佳气似烟非。\n抗节衷无隐，同心尚弼违。\n良哉致君日，维岳有光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}